{"id":7,"slug":"maximum-subarray","title":"Maximum Subarray","difficulty":"Easy","tags":["Array","Dynamic Programming","Divide and Conquer"],"description":"Given an integer array `nums`, find the contiguous subarray with the largest sum and return that sum.\n\nThe subarray must contain at least one element.\n\n**Constraints**\n\n- `1 <= nums.length <= 2 * 10^5`\n- `-10^4 <= nums[i] <= 10^4`","functionName":"maxSubArray","params":["nums"],"tests":[{"input":[[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]],"output":6,"sample":true,"explanation":"[4,-1,2,1] sums to 6."},{"input":[[1]],"output":1,"sample":true},{"input":[[5,4,-1,7,8]],"output":23},{"input":[[-1]],"output":-1},{"input":[[-2,-1,-3]],"output":-1},{"input":[[8,-19,5,-4,20]],"output":21},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":1,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1100}],"output":-49},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":2,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1101}],"output":78},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":3,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1102}],"output":100},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":5,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1103}],"output":105},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":10,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1104}],"output":164},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":50,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1105}],"output":350},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":500,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1106}],"output":1014},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":5000,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1107}],"output":5478},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":200000,"lo":-100,"hi":100,"seed":1108}],"output":29100},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":100000,"lo":-10000,"hi":-1,"seed":1120}],"output":-1},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":100000,"lo":1,"hi":10000,"seed":1121}],"output":499108376},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":100000,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":1122}],"output":1060724},{"input":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":-1,"n":100000}],"output":-1},{"input":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":0,"n":100000}],"output":0},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":-10000,"n":50000},{"__gen__":"repeat","value":1,"n":50000}]}],"output":50000},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[{"__gen__":"repeat","value":1,"n":50000},{"__gen__":"repeat","value":-10000,"n":50000}]}],"output":50000},{"input":[[0]],"output":0},{"input":[[-2,1]],"output":1},{"input":[[1,-2,3]],"output":3},{"input":[[-2,-1]],"output":-1},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":4,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5160}],"output":2549},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":12,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5161}],"output":18953},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":80,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5162}],"output":25680},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":800,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5163}],"output":259867},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":8000,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5164}],"output":996487},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":80000,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5165}],"output":891201},{"input":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":150000,"lo":-10000,"hi":10000,"seed":5166}],"output":2448605},{"input":[{"__gen__":"concat","parts":[{"__gen__":"ints","n":50000,"lo":-10,"hi":10,"seed":5170},[10000],{"__gen__":"ints","n":50000,"lo":-10,"hi":10,"seed":5171}]}],"output":11131},{"input":[{"__gen__":"shuffle","of":{"__gen__":"arange","n":100000,"start":-50000},"seed":5172}],"output":12869916}],"hints":["At each index, either extend the previous subarray or start a new one there.","That decision is Kadane's algorithm: `best_ending_here = max(x, best_ending_here + x)`."],"complexity":"O(n) time, O(1) space","starter":{"python":"def maxSubArray(nums):\n    # TODO: implement\n    pass\n","javascript":"/**\n * @param {*} nums\n * @return {*}\n */\nvar maxSubArray = function (nums) {\n  // TODO: implement\n};\n"},"editorial":{"explanation":"Kadane's algorithm. At each index ask one question: is it better to extend the previous subarray or\nto start fresh here? The answer is `max(nums[i], best_ending_here + nums[i])`.\n\nTrack that running value plus the best seen anywhere, and the answer falls out in `O(n)` time and\n`O(1)` space.\n\nStarting `best` at negative infinity (not zero) is what makes all-negative arrays work — the answer\nis then the largest single element.","code":{"python":"def maxSubArray(nums):\n    best = cur = nums[0]\n    for x in nums[1:]:\n        cur = max(x, cur + x)\n        best = max(best, cur)\n    return best\n"},"complexity":"O(n) time, O(1) space"}}
